From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Marull-Paretas <gerard@teslabs.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: riscv: cpus: Add Nordic VPR

Document the compatible of the Nordic VPR, the RISC-V core of the
peripheral processors of the Nordic nRF54 series, such as the FLPR of
the nRF54L15.

These schemas are now used by PebbleOS, which runs on the FLPR.
---
 riscv/cpus.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/riscv/cpus.yaml b/riscv/cpus.yaml
index 0da219a..84a0957 100644
--- a/riscv/cpus.yaml
+++ b/riscv/cpus.yaml
@@ -48,6 +48,7 @@ properties:
               - amd,mbv64
               - andestech,ax45mp
               - canaan,k210
+              - nordic,vpr
               - nuclei,ux900
               - sifive,bullet0
               - sifive,e5
